OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 12, who could not swim
OL,4,Adrowned after river current took hold
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis family asked people to remember
OL,7,FJunior's "blue eyes, his smile, his
OL,8,Flaugh" and his "huge heart", while a
OL,9,Ffamily friend called for better water
OL,10,Fsafety education.
OL,12,FAssistant coroner Richard Taylor found
OL,13,FJunior's death was accidental.
